        "Heat oil, add jeera, then onion, grated ginger and green chilli and fry until golden.",
        "Add tomato with turmeric, chilli and coriander powder and cook until soft.",
        "Add potato and cauliflower with salt, toss to coat and cover.",
        "Cook on low without adding water, stirring gently, until the vegetables are tender and lightly roasted.",
        "Sprinkle garam masala and coriander before serving."
      ],
